      "purposeInStoryline": "Final lesson of the storyline. Lessons 1-7 gathered evidence on vegetative propagation, flower structure, features that hinder self-pollination, double fertilisation, and seed and fruit development with placentation. Lesson 8 pulls this together so each learner can answer the Driving Question: Why do some farm plants produce offspring without seeds while others require seeds and a partner tree to make fruit? There is no new question for next lesson because the unit is complete.",
